Package: pveSim
Type: Package
Title: MRI Partial Volume Error Simulator
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Tim Koscik, PhD <tkoscik@uams.edu>
  Maintainer: Tim Koscik, PhD <tkoscik@uams.edu>
  Description: A high-utility, standalone framework designed to simulate, 
    visualize, and quantify the directional biases and measurement errors 
    introduced by partial volume effects (PVE) across standard, irregular, 
    and laminar analytical structures under custom voxel anisotropy configurations.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
